# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Local, per-machine switchboard config. `defaults/` ships the baseline; anything here is
# this checkout's own override and is deliberately not shared. Worktrees get symlinks to
# the main checkout's copy rather than their own.
#
# What this repo wants EVERY agent to have, including in a fresh clone, goes in the
# committed `.switchboard-shared/` instead — which is tracked precisely because neither the
# ignore below nor the worktree symlink lets anything here travel.
/.switchboard/
/CLAUDE.md

# Claude Code's per-machine permission grants
/.claude/

# Scratch
*.tmp
.DS_Store

# Agent scratch that must never be committed. Each of these has been written into the
# repo root by an agent at least once; ignoring them is cheaper than catching it in review.
/.scout-*.md
/.resume-review/
/recruiting/
